ed length of the speech discussed. \n (Convention floor: Peter Jennings)  Report introduced. \n (Boston: Jake Tapper)  Kerry's speaking & personal style examined; various scenes shown of Kerry on the campaign trail.  [February 15, then-candidate Senator John EDWARDS\u00a0- reacts to Kerry's long answer.]  [Last year, KERRY\u00a0- jokes about being aloof.]  [Former Gore campaign adviser Michael FELDMAN\u2020- talks about the opportunity of a convention.]  [Former Reagan speechwriter Ken KHACHIGIAN\u2020- suggests Kerry relax.] \n (Convention floor: Peter Jennings)  A small demonstration by the Black Tea Society, a group of anarchists, shown.", "segment_duration": 430, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761025, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "9yPJhy2X2W", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-29", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761024, "segment_id": "yAX5U3ybD9", "segment_broadcast_id": "9yPJhy2X2W", "segment_title": "Pakistan / Al Qaeda / Ghailani Capture", "segment_description": "(Convention floor: Peter Jennings)  Report introduced.   (Washington: Pierre Thomas)  The capture in Pakistan of senior Al Qaeda member Ahmed Khalfan Ghailani&#134;, who is wanted for his role in the bombings of the embassies in Kenya & Tanzania, featured; scenes shown from the August 1998 bombings.  [May 26, FBI director Robert MUELLER&#134;- speaks about sought-after Al Qaeda figures.]", "segment_duration": 90, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63480.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761026, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "